      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "私、イデュイア地方から商売で来たのですが\n帰り道の途中に、猛獣がたむろしてるらしくて……\n藁にもすがる気持ちなのです。\n猛獣どもを追っ払ってもらえないでしょうか？",
        "official_en": "I came from Idyia on business, but now that I\nwant to head home, there's wild beasts blocking\nthe road. Could you please help me by getting rid\nof those terrible beasts?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
