      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "猛獣を追っ払っていただいて、助かりました！\nこれでようやく自分の店に帰れます。\nリーベルタス関から東も面白い所ですよ。\nまたゆっくり訪ねてみてね、お兄ちゃん！",
        "official_en": "Thank you for clearing out the wild beasts! Now I\ncan finally get home and back to my shop. By the\nway, the area to the east of Libertas Stronghold is \nsomewhere I think you'd find interesting to visit!",
        "real_en": "Thank you for clearing out the wild beasts! Now I\ncan finally get home and back to my shop. By the\nway, the area to the east of Libertus Stronghold is \nsomewhere I think you'd find interesting to visit!"
